When inputs change, re-derived Briefs retain absent prior entries with `change: "removed"`. This renderer filters only storyline questions, so iterative generation still sends removed exclusions, confidence facts, and glossary terms to section agents as active guidance. A report can therefore be generated from evidence that the current Brief explicitly removed. The ordered-generation reader already avoids this by filtering out removed entries.

