### comment_id=4008691166 convex/ai/orderedGeneration.ts:237 (commit 36a234d)
[P1] **Section actions can time out**

A single section action can run a draft call, two compression calls, a Self-check, and a repair sequentially. Each Anthropic call permits two 240-second attempts, so this path can exceed the repository's 600-second Convex action limit before either completion or failure is persisted. The claimed section then remains running, and the ordered chain stalls until stale cleanup fails the generation.

