95:| Readiness | any stage → `ready_for_delivery` | Requires a promoted branch and applicable readiness checks; fails closed until branch storage applies |
97:Entering `internal_review` no longer requires an active internal-review handoff: stage and assignment remain separate records, and "Send for internal review" may still atomically create the handoff and offer the stage change with user confirmation.
