219:| D5 | Financial visibility | **Deferred with default** | Admin and Manager can read/write existing financial data. The planned Financial role receives client/claim-period financial access plus only the technical-report context required for that work; Consultants have no broad financial access by default. | Exact field/query scope is finalized in PSOS-28 and PSOS-31/32 before the role is enabled. |
